{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/AI Control Problem.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/AI Control Problem.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"ai control problem ai control problem","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/AI Control Problem.md","fileName":"AI Control Problem.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"AI Control Problem","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-05 23:09\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[AI Futures and Human Identity]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["AI Futures and Human Identity","Superintelligence","Algorithmic Accountability","aiethics.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/AI Control Problem.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/AI Control Problem.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"ai control problem ai control problem","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/AI Control Problem.md","fileName":"AI Control Problem.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"AI Control Problem","heading":"AI Control Problem","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"The AI control problem asks how humans could ensure that a highly capable autonomous system continues to pursue acceptable goals. The difficulty is that a formal objective may not include every value, exception, or context its designers intended. A system that optimizes the objective effectively may therefore create destructive side effects without disobeying its instructions.\n\nThe problem is often discussed in relation to [[Superintelligence]], but a practical version already appears whenever people cannot predict, understand, or interrupt an automated decision process. Present governance adds human oversight, constraints, testing, and [[Algorithmic Accountability]] rather than assuming that technical optimization alone guarantees alignment.","tags":["baby"],"links":["AI Futures and Human Identity","Superintelligence","Algorithmic Accountability","aiethics.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/AI Control Problem.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/AI Control Problem.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"ai control problem ai control problem","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/AI Control Problem.md","fileName":"AI Control Problem.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"AI Control Problem","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[aiethics.epub]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["AI Futures and Human Identity","Superintelligence","Algorithmic Accountability","aiethics.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}